---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Read the Terapixel Games privacy policy, including cookies, advertising, and support contact details."
>
  <div class="shell stack">
    <header class="page-head">
      <h1 class="page-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="page-copy">Last updated: May 1, 2026</p>
    </header>

    <section class="glass-panel text-panel">
      <h2>Overview</h2>
      <p>
        Terapixel Games is committed to responsible data handling. This page explains what information may be collected
        when you use our website and browser games.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="glass-panel text-panel">
      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>
        We may receive limited technical information such as browser type, device details, pages visited, approximate
        region, referring pages, and basic interaction events through analytics, hosting, and advertising providers.
      </p>
      <p>
        We do not require sensitive personal information to play. If you email us, we only process the details you choose
        to share.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="glass-panel text-panel">
      <h2>Cookies and Advertising</h2>
      <p>
        This site may use cookies and similar technologies for performance measurement and to support advertising,
        including Google AdSense. Third-party providers may use cookies to serve, personalize, limit, and measure ads
        according to their own policies and user controls.
      </p>
      <p>
        Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on a user's prior visits to this website
        or other websites. Google's use of advertising cookies enables Google and its partners to serve ads based on
        visits to this site and other sites on the internet.
      </p>
      <p>
        Visitors may opt out of personalized advertising through
        <a href="https://adssettings.google.com/" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Ads Settings</a>. Visitors may also
        opt out of some third-party vendors' uses of cookies for personalized advertising through
        <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" rel="noopener noreferrer">AboutAds.info</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        We do not ask visitors to click ads, and ads are kept separate from game controls, navigation, and download or
        launch links.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="glass-panel text-panel">
      <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>
        Some game content is delivered through third-party platforms. Those services may process data under their own
        privacy policies.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="glass-panel text-panel">
      <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>Our website is not directed to children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="glass-panel text-panel">
      <h2>Policy Updates</h2>
      <p>We may update this policy as products evolve. Updates are posted here with a revised effective date.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="glass-panel text-panel">
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        For privacy questions, email <a href="mailto:support@terapixel.games">support@terapixel.games</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
